{"unit_id":"lordraiden__dsh-9router-web-search#card-zh","repo":"lordraiden/dsh-9router-web-search","commit":"cff02e9000f53d129f4fe461c8d51b50cc8cb7fe","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-9router-web-search 是面向 DSH Web 客户端的网页搜索与抓取插件。它把 DSH 的 web_search 和 web_fetch provider 注册到 ctx.web，并通过 bundle patch 将两项能力指向 9router。搜索会把查询发送到网关并整理去重结果；抓取会请求页面内容、映射正文格式并限制返回字符数。插件还提供 baseURL、模型、超时、格式和结果上限等配置，适合希望在 DSH 中使用 9router 网关搜索网页并读取页面内容的用户。使用时需配置 9router 网关地址；仅当网关要求认证时才需提供 API 密钥。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.js:181-247","src/index.js:264-359","cordis.patch.yml:1-13"]}
{"unit_id":"lordraiden__dsh-9router-web-search#card-en","repo":"lordraiden/dsh-9router-web-search","commit":"cff02e9000f53d129f4fe461c8d51b50cc8cb7fe","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-9router-web-search adds 9router web search and page fetching to DSH. It registers providers on the web seam. Search maps results to deduplicated sources; fetch returns page content in supported formats with a character limit. Configure a gateway URL and, when required, an API key.","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.js:181-247","src/index.js:264-359","cordis.patch.yml:1-13"]}
